whether they can continue in their jobs if they become Christians. The minister
of a new congregation in Moscow asked about that issue. A policeman had asked
whether he would have to quit his job if he accepted Christ.&lt;/span>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>PACIFICISM, SELF-DEFENSE, AND PROTECTING OTHERS</title><link>https://christir.org/essays/topics/christian-doctrine/ethics/pacificism-self-defense-and-protecting-others/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://christir.org/essays/topics/christian-doctrine/ethics/pacificism-self-defense-and-protecting-others/</guid><description>&lt;style>
