&lt;p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:-.5in;text-align:justify'>&lt;span
style='font-size:12.0pt'>            Ethics and morality relate to the
interpersonal realm, with humankind. Since persons in relationship constitutes
the most complex reality there is, ethics is a complex discipline.&lt;/span>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>THREE THOUGHTS ON ABORTION</title><link>https://christir.org/essays/topics/christian-doctrine/ethics/three-thoughts-on-abortion/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://christir.org/essays/topics/christian-doctrine/ethics/three-thoughts-on-abortion/</guid><description>&lt;style>
